## Vendored material

`third_party/osworld/` is **not** covered by the MIT licence above. It is
copied unmodified from [xlang-ai/OSWorld](https://github.com/xlang-ai/OSWorld)
at commit `5123bfdbbc` and remains under the Apache License 2.0; the full text
is in `third_party/osworld/LICENSE`. The vendored tree contains the OSWorld
evaluators (`desktop_env/evaluators/`) and the 143 task definitions
(`evaluation_examples/examples/{gimp,libreoffice_calc,libreoffice_writer,libreoffice_impress}/`)
that this benchmark scores against. Attribution notices from the original
project are preserved.

The task set and graders are third-party material by design: the point of the
benchmark is to measure harnesses on tasks nobody tuned for them.
